What this has to do with Nethack I'll never know, but here's a solution.

Use the system V version of touch (which is probably in /usr/5bin )

Then "touch mmddhhmm fileneme"
Where mm is month, dd is date, hh is hours, and mm is minutres.
i.e. touch 03151200 file will change the date to 15th March at 12:00.
You may want to use -a for access time only, or -m for modification time.

